Common tools used
Databricks: Notebooks, compute, Delta Lake, Jobs, Lakeflow.
Languages: Python, PySpark, SQL.
Cloud storage: Azure Data Lake Storage, Amazon S3, or Google Cloud Storage.
Orchestration: Databricks Jobs, Azure Data Factory, or other schedulers.
Governance: Unity Catalog.
Version control and deployment: Git, Azure DevOps, or GitHub.
Reporting: Power BI or Tableau.
